{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/44195/", "pk": 44195, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/", "pk": 13096, "shortname": "floridaadventuresandrentals", "name": "Florida Adventures and Rentals", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Marco Island Wildlife Sightseeing and Shelling Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 6, "unicode": "Marco Island Wildlife Sightseeing and Shelling Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 2, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 5000, "description": "# VOTED #1 BOAT TOUR ON MARCO ISLAND\n\n***Private Tours also available*** \n\n##Duration\n\n2 hours\n\n## About\nOn our 2 hour Marco Island Shelling Tour we depart from the Goodland Boat Ramp located at 750 Palm Point Dr, Goodland, FL 34140. On our two hour ecotour you will experience one of the most popular adventures we are known for, we will take you for an exciting and scenic cruise through the Ten Thousand Islands, where our Captains and Guides will provide information about the ecology of this unique ecosystem. After cruising through the mangrove islands, we will stop on a private beach in search of the most exotic tropical sea shells that the Gulf coast is known for. This is a very informational adventure that will keep small children and adults engaged the whole time. This is a semi-private, or private boat tour with a maximum of 14 guests on non private tours. Our boats are very kid friendly. Comfortable seating and a ladder off the front of the boat for easy loading and unloading right onto the beach.\n\n\n## Departure Location\nWe depart from the **Goodland Boat Ramp located at 750 Palm Point Dr, Goodland, FL 34140.** This location includes a 5.22 acre park, restrooms, concessions for sale from sunscreen to food and allows easy access to the Ten Thousand Islands and Gulf of Mexico.\n\n\n##Customizable\nDepending on your preference and group size we have many different tour options to accommodate your party. Marco Island sits atop the 10,000 Islands. With so many amazing beaches just south of us, only accessible by boat, these islands are littered with amazing shells. Our guides have incredible understandings of tides, currents, weather patterns and prevalence of different species of shells to help you find the treasures you are searching for. Whether it’s your first time combing the beach or you are an avid collector, we know where to find the best shells this area is known for. Meet fellow adventurers and shell lovers or schedule a private tour for your group. We welcome individuals wanting to adventure on their own as well as large groups.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Goodland Boat Park", "booking_notes": "![Thank you for booking](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6HeSiQ6XQ2SGZN4lGJ7I)\n[![CLICK HERE FOR DIRECTIONS](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ggr7BmDWRneMAwYCoEPO)](https://www.google.com/maps/dir/25.955731,-81.7238755/GOODLAND+BOATING+PARK/@25.9391063,-81.7682825,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!4m8!1m1!4e1!1m5!1m1!1s0x88daf10a7e5f5a7b:0xd9efbd83fb662eaa!2m2!1d-81.6464898!2d25.9217576?entry=ttu)", "cancellation_notes": "Cust